  "title": "Jewelled Roast Mediterranean Bellflower-Root-Doraji Roast",
  "description": "Fresh, tender, and comforting Mediterranean dish featuring bellflower-root-doraji, perfect for a sick day.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
